# Modules the Waybar config actually uses.
#
# Without these the bar logs `Unknown module: <name>` for each and renders an
# empty slot: mpris (media player), network, pulseaudio (volume) and tray.
# Rebuild only: `sudo emerge -1 gui-apps/waybar` - the dry run shows no new
# dependencies.
gui-apps/waybar mpris network pulseaudio tray
